 artist performing in \"Live at the El Rey\".", "answer": "Jack's Mannequin", "quote": "The concert film features 14 songs taken from two nights at the El Rey Theatre, and on the DVD are woven together with interview footage of Andrew chronicling seven years of living, writing, recording and touring as Jack's Mannequin. The bonus portion of the DVD includes 9 performance-only cuts as well. Live from the El Rey Theatre Live from the El Rey Theatre is a live music CD and DVD by the band Jack's Mannequin.", "original_document_number": 5}], "current_answers": ["Mutemath", "Collide", "Stephen Lynch", "Jack's Mannequin"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Mutemath", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Collide", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R2", "answer": "Stephen Lynch", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R3", "answer": "Jack's Mannequin", "origin": "initial"}]}
